    <title>RESTful API 設計主要原則</title>
    <link href="/2025/10/03/restful-api-design-principles/"/>
    <url>/2025/10/03/restful-api-design-principles/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="核心原則"><a href="#核心原則" class="headerlink" title="核心原則"></a>核心原則</h2><h3 id="1-使用-HTTP-方法（HTTP-Verbs）"><a href="#1-使用-HTTP-方法（HTTP-Verbs）" class="headerlink" title="1. 使用 HTTP 方法（HTTP Verbs）"></a>1. <strong>使用 HTTP 方法（HTTP Verbs）</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>GET</strong>: 獲取資源</li><li><strong>POST</strong>: 創建新資源</li><li><strong>PUT</strong>: 完整更新資源</li><li><strong>PATCH</strong>: 部分更新資源</li><li><strong>DELETE</strong>: 刪除資源</li></ul><p><strong>範例：</strong></p><figure class="highlight awk"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs awk">GET    <span class="hljs-regexp">/api/u</span>sers          <span class="hljs-comment"># 獲取所有用戶</span><br>GET    <span class="hljs-regexp">/api/u</span>sers/<span class="hljs-number">123</span>      <span class="hljs-comment"># 獲取特定用戶</span><br>POST   <span class="hljs-regexp">/api/u</span>sers          <span class="hljs-comment"># 創建新用戶</span><br>PUT    <span class="hljs-regexp">/api/u</span>sers/<span class="hljs-number">123</span>      <span class="hljs-comment"># 完整更新用戶</span><br>PATCH  <span class="hljs-regexp">/api/u</span>sers/<span class="hljs-number">123</span>      <span class="hljs-comment"># 部分更新用戶</span><br>DELETE <span class="hljs-regexp">/api/u</span>sers/<span class="hljs-number">123</span>      <span class="hljs-comment"># 刪除用戶</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-使用名詞而非動詞"><a href="#2-使用名詞而非動詞" class="headerlink" title="2. 使用名詞而非動詞"></a>2. <strong>使用名詞而非動詞</strong></h3><p>URL 應該代表資源（名詞），而不是操作（動詞）</p><p><strong>✅ 好的設計：</strong></p><figure class="highlight gradle"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs gradle">GET <span class="hljs-regexp">/api/</span>articles/<span class="hljs-number">123</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">DELETE</span> <span class="hljs-regexp">/api/</span>articles/<span class="hljs-number">123</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>❌ 不好的設計：</strong></p><figure class="highlight apache"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs apache"><span class="hljs-attribute">GET</span> /api/getArticle/<span class="hljs-number">123</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">POST</span> /api/deleteArticle/<span class="hljs-number">123</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-使用複數名詞"><a href="#3-使用複數名詞" class="headerlink" title="3. 使用複數名詞"></a>3. <strong>使用複數名詞</strong></h3><p>保持一致性，端點使用複數形式</p><p><strong>範例：</strong></p><figure class="highlight awk"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs awk"><span class="hljs-regexp">/api/u</span>sers          <span class="hljs-comment"># 而非 /api/user</span><br><span class="hljs-regexp">/api/</span>products       <span class="hljs-comment"># 而非 /api/product</span><br><span class="hljs-regexp">/api/</span>orders         <span class="hljs-comment"># 而非 /api/order</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-資源層級關係（Nested-Resources）"><a href="#4-資源層級關係（Nested-Resources）" class="headerlink" title="4. 資源層級關係（Nested Resources）"></a>4. <strong>資源層級關係（Nested Resources）</strong></h3><p>表達資源之間的關聯</p><p><strong>範例：</strong></p><figure class="highlight awk"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs awk">GET <span class="hljs-regexp">/api/u</span>sers<span class="hljs-regexp">/123/</span>orders           <span class="hljs-comment"># 獲取用戶的所有訂單</span><br>GET <span class="hljs-regexp">/api/u</span>sers<span class="hljs-regexp">/123/</span>orders/<span class="hljs-number">456</span>       <span class="hljs-comment"># 獲取用戶的特定訂單</span><br>POST <span class="hljs-regexp">/api/</span>articles<span class="hljs-regexp">/789/</span>comments     <span class="hljs-comment"># 為文章創建評論</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="5-使用適當的-HTTP-狀態碼"><a href="#5-使用適當的-HTTP-狀態碼" class="headerlink" title="5. 使用適當的 HTTP 狀態碼"></a>5. <strong>使用適當的 HTTP 狀態碼</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>200 OK</strong>: 請求成功</li><li><strong>201 Created</strong>: 資源創建成功</li><li><strong>204 No Content</strong>: 成功但無返回內容</li><li><strong>400 Bad Request</strong>: 請求錯誤</li><li><strong>401 Unauthorized</strong>: 未授權</li><li><strong>403 Forbidden</strong>: 禁止訪問</li><li><strong>404 Not Found</strong>: 資源不存在</li><li><strong>500 Internal Server Error</strong>: 伺服器錯誤</li></ul><h3 id="6-版本控制（Versioning）"><a href="#6-版本控制（Versioning）" class="headerlink" title="6. 版本控制（Versioning）"></a>6. <strong>版本控制（Versioning）</strong></h3><p>在 API 設計中包含版本號</p><p><strong>範例：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">/api/v1/users<br>/api/v2/users<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>或使用 Header：</p><figure class="highlight ada"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ada"><span class="hljs-keyword">Accept</span>: application/vnd.myapi.v1+json<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="7-使用查詢參數進行過濾、排序、分頁"><a href="#7-使用查詢參數進行過濾、排序、分頁" class="headerlink" title="7. 使用查詢參數進行過濾、排序、分頁"></a>7. <strong>使用查詢參數進行過濾、排序、分頁</strong></h3><p><strong>範例：</strong></p><figure class="highlight routeros"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs routeros"><span class="hljs-built_in">GET</span> /api/products?<span class="hljs-attribute">category</span>=electronics&amp;sort=price&amp;order=desc<br><span class="hljs-built_in">GET</span> /api/users?<span class="hljs-attribute">page</span>=2&amp;limit=20<br><span class="hljs-built_in">GET</span> /api/articles?<span class="hljs-attribute">search</span>=technology&amp;published=true<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="8-提供有意義的錯誤訊息"><a href="#8-提供有意義的錯誤訊息" class="headerlink" title="8. 提供有意義的錯誤訊息"></a>8. <strong>提供有意義的錯誤訊息</strong></h3><p><strong>範例回應：</strong></p><figure class="highlight json"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs json"><span class="hljs-punctuation">&#123;</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;error&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#123;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;code&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;INVALID_EMAIL&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;message&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;提供的電子郵件格式不正確&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;field&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;email&quot;</span><br>  <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#125;</span><br><span class="hljs-punctuation">&#125;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="完整範例：部落格-API"><a href="#完整範例：部落格-API" class="headerlink" title="完整範例：部落格 API"></a>完整範例：部落格 API</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 文章（Articles）</span><br>GET    /api/v1/articles                 <span class="hljs-comment"># 獲取所有文章</span><br>GET    /api/v1/articles?page=1&amp;<span class="hljs-built_in">limit</span>=10 <span class="hljs-comment"># 分頁獲取</span><br>GET    /api/v1/articles/123             <span class="hljs-comment"># 獲取特定文章</span><br>POST   /api/v1/articles                 <span class="hljs-comment"># 創建新文章</span><br>PUT    /api/v1/articles/123             <span class="hljs-comment"># 更新文章</span><br>DELETE /api/v1/articles/123             <span class="hljs-comment"># 刪除文章</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 評論（Comments）</span><br>GET    /api/v1/articles/123/comments    <span class="hljs-comment"># 獲取文章的所有評論</span><br>POST   /api/v1/articles/123/comments    <span class="hljs-comment"># 為文章添加評論</span><br>DELETE /api/v1/comments/456             <span class="hljs-comment"># 刪除特定評論</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 作者（Authors）</span><br>GET    /api/v1/authors/789/articles     <span class="hljs-comment"># 獲取作者的所有文章</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
