  <entry>
    <title>PHP 枚舉（Enum）在物件轉換中的行為</title>
    <link href="/2025/04/19/php-enum-object-conversion/"/>
    <url>/2025/04/19/php-enum-object-conversion/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="基本概念"><a href="#基本概念" class="headerlink" title="基本概念"></a>基本概念</h2><p>PHP 8.1 引入的枚舉（Enum）提供了定義一組命名常數的方式。PHP 支援兩種類型的枚舉：</p><ol><li><strong>純枚舉（Pure Enums）</strong>：僅包含名稱</li><li><strong>備份枚舉（Backed Enums）</strong>：包含名稱和對應的值（字串或整數）</li></ol><h2 id="備份枚舉的自動轉換行為"><a href="#備份枚舉的自動轉換行為" class="headerlink" title="備份枚舉的自動轉換行為"></a>備份枚舉的自動轉換行為</h2><p>備份枚舉在以下情境中會自動轉換為其備份值：</p><ul><li>轉換為 JSON</li><li>轉換為陣列</li><li>序列化</li><li>資料庫儲存</li><li>作為陣列元素</li></ul><h3 id="關鍵特性"><a href="#關鍵特性" class="headerlink" title="關鍵特性"></a>關鍵特性</h3><ul><li>當備份枚舉被放入陣列並轉換為 JSON 時，會顯示為其備份值而非枚舉名稱</li><li>這種行為是 PHP 的內建特性，不需要額外程式碼</li><li>對於字串備份枚舉，會轉換為字串值；對於整數備份枚舉，會轉換為整數值</li></ul><h2 id="程式碼示例"><a href="#程式碼示例" class="headerlink" title="程式碼示例"></a>程式碼示例</h2><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs php"><span class="hljs-comment">// 定義備份枚舉</span><br><span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">enum</span> <span class="hljs-title">StatusEnum</span>: <span class="hljs-title">string</span></span><br><span class="hljs-class"></span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> Active = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;active&#x27;</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> Pending = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;pending&#x27;</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> Inactive = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;inactive&#x27;</span>;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 在物件中使用枚舉</span><br><span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">User</span></span><br><span class="hljs-class"></span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">__construct</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span></span><br><span class="hljs-params"><span class="hljs-function">        <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">string</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$name</span>,</span></span><br><span class="hljs-params"><span class="hljs-function">        <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> StatusEnum <span class="hljs-variable">$status</span></span></span><br><span class="hljs-params"><span class="hljs-function">    </span>) </span>&#123;&#125;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">toArray</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>): <span class="hljs-title">array</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function">    </span>&#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> [<br>            <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;name&#x27;</span> =&gt; <span class="hljs-variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;name,<br>            <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;status&#x27;</span> =&gt; <span class="hljs-variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;status, <span class="hljs-comment">// 在轉換過程中，枚舉會變為字串</span><br>        ];<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 使用範例</span><br><span class="hljs-variable">$user</span> = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">User</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;王小明&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-title class_">StatusEnum</span>::<span class="hljs-variable constant_">Active</span>);<br><span class="hljs-variable">$array</span> = <span class="hljs-variable">$user</span>-&gt;<span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">toArray</span>(); <span class="hljs-comment">// [&#x27;name&#x27; =&gt; &#x27;王小明&#x27;, &#x27;status&#x27; =&gt; &#x27;active&#x27;]</span><br><span class="hljs-variable">$json</span> = <span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">json_encode</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$array</span>); <span class="hljs-comment">// &#123;&quot;name&quot;:&quot;王小明&quot;,&quot;status&quot;:&quot;active&quot;&#125;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="純枚舉的轉換行為"><a href="#純枚舉的轉換行為" class="headerlink" title="純枚舉的轉換行為"></a>純枚舉的轉換行為</h2><p>與備份枚舉不同，純枚舉在轉換時：</p><ul><li>不會自動轉換為簡單值</li><li>當嘗試 JSON 編碼時會產生錯誤（除非實現 JsonSerializable 接口）</li><li>需要手動處理其轉換邏輯</li></ul><h3 id="程式碼示例-1"><a href="#程式碼示例-1" class="headerlink" title="程式碼示例"></a>程式碼示例</h3><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs php"><span class="hljs-comment">// 定義純枚舉</span><br><span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">enum</span> <span class="hljs-title">Direction</span></span><br><span class="hljs-class"></span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> North;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> East;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> South;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> West;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 嘗試直接轉換純枚舉</span><br><span class="hljs-variable">$direction</span> = <span class="hljs-title class_">Direction</span>::<span class="hljs-variable constant_">North</span>;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 這會產生錯誤：不能將枚舉對象轉換為字串</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">// $text = &quot;方向是：&quot; . $direction;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 嘗試編碼包含純枚舉的陣列</span><br><span class="hljs-variable">$data</span> = [<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;direction&#x27;</span> =&gt; <span class="hljs-variable">$direction</span>];<br><span class="hljs-comment">// 這會產生錯誤：無法 JSON 編碼 - 物件類型 Direction 不支援</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">// $json = json_encode($data);</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 正確做法：實現 JsonSerializable 接口</span><br><span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">enum</span> <span class="hljs-title">DirectionWithJson</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">implements</span> \<span class="hljs-title">JsonSerializable</span></span><br><span class="hljs-class"></span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> North;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> East;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> South;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">case</span> West;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">jsonSerialize</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>): <span class="hljs-title">mixed</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function">    </span>&#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;name; <span class="hljs-comment">// 返回枚舉名稱</span><br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 現在可以成功編碼</span><br><span class="hljs-variable">$direction</span> = <span class="hljs-title class_">DirectionWithJson</span>::<span class="hljs-variable constant_">North</span>;<br><span class="hljs-variable">$data</span> = [<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;direction&#x27;</span> =&gt; <span class="hljs-variable">$direction</span>];<br><span class="hljs-variable">$json</span> = <span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">json_encode</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$data</span>); <span class="hljs-comment">// &#123;&quot;direction&quot;:&quot;North&quot;&#125;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="實用技巧"><a href="#實用技巧" class="headerlink" title="實用技巧"></a>實用技巧</h2><ol><li><strong>自訂序列化行為</strong>：實現 <code>JsonSerializable</code> 接口可自訂序列化行為</li><li><strong>枚舉方法</strong>：可在枚舉中添加方法以提供更多功能</li><li><strong>轉換輔助函數</strong>：建立專用函數處理枚舉的特殊轉換需求</li></ol><h2 id="效能考量"><a href="#效能考量" class="headerlink" title="效能考量"></a>效能考量</h2><ul><li>備份枚舉的自動轉換無需額外處理，效能開銷極小</li><li>轉換大量包含枚舉的物件時，效能表現良好</li></ul><p>這種自動轉換機制使得 PHP 枚舉非常適合用於 API 回應和資料序列化的情境，無需額外的轉換邏輯即可獲得適合的資料表示形式。</p>]]></content>
    
    
